      "title": "👑 Pixaroma - Note - START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Nunchaku Z-Image DiT Loader\n### Download the right **nunchaku z-image model** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/nunchaku-ai/nunchaku-z-image-turbo/tree/main)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/z-image` \n\nCreate the `z-image` folder if it does not exist)\n \nUse **FP4 models** if you have an **RTX 50-series or newer GPU**.\n\nUse **INT4 models** for RTX 40, 30 or older GPUs.\n\nThe **r** value controls quality: **r32, r128, r256.**\n\nHigher values give better quality but use more VRAM.\n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **Huihui-Qwen3-4B-abliterated-v2_fp8mixed.safetensors** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/Qwen3-4B-ComfyQuants-SingleFiles/resolve/main/Huihui-Qwen3-4B-abliterated-v2_fp8mixed.safetensors?download=true)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`  \n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **ae.safetensor** (flux 1 vae) from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- ComfyUI-nunchaku (installed with nunchaku.bat from Add-Ons folder)\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n"
      ],
